{"seq":1,"slug":"exception-case-assign","title":"例外工单分派与路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/case-investigation-sla/exception-case-assign","wordCount":1748,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"例外工单分派与路由\">例外工单分派与路由</h1><p>一张差异工单被创建之后，第一件要决定的事是&quot;谁来看&quot;。这件事看着像&quot;按渠道分给对应运营组&quot;那么简单，实际上决定了对账团队 70% 的响应时间：分错队列会让工单在三个组之间来回转手，一个本可当天查清的短款可能拖到第二周；分给不在岗的人会让工单静默躺在个人队列里，直到 SLA 超时报警才被发现；把同一根因的 400 笔差异拆成 400 张单，会让四个运营同时查同一份渠道文件。路由设计的目标因此不是&quot;把单分出去&quot;，而是<strong>让每张单在正确的时间落到正确的能力集合上</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-路由是匹配问题-不是查表问题\">核心概念：路由是匹配问题，不是查表问题</h2><p>路由的本质是&quot;把工单的属性向量映射到处理者（人或组）的能力向量&quot;。最简单的实现是一张 <code>渠道 → 组</code> 的映射表，但它在三种情况下立刻失效：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;新差异工单&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;技能匹配&lt;br/&gt;差异类型 × 币种 × 业务&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;容量检查&lt;br/&gt;队列在办数 / 并发上限&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D{&quot;有人可接？&quot;}&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| E[&quot;按最小负载分派&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| F[&quot;溢出策略&lt;br/&gt;备用组 / 延时重试&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; G[&quot;负责人确定&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; H[&quot;进溢出池&lt;br/&gt;保留 SLA 时钟&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; I[&quot;写入分派记录&lt;br/&gt;可追溯&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n  A[\"新差异工单\"] --&gt; B[\"技能匹配&lt;br/&gt;差异类型 × 币种 × 业务\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"容量检查&lt;br/&gt;队列在办数 / 并发上限\"]\n  C --&gt; D{\"有人可接？\"}\n  D --&gt;|\"是\"| E[\"按最小负载分派\"]\n  D --&gt;|\"否\"| F[\"溢出策略&lt;br/&gt;备用组 / 延时重试\"]\n  E --&gt; G[\"负责人确定\"]\n  F --&gt; H[\"进溢出池&lt;br/&gt;保留 SLA 时钟\"]\n  G --&gt; I[\"写入分派记录&lt;br/&gt;可追溯\"]\n  H --&gt; I</pre><p>三种失效情况是：<strong>技能交叉</strong>（同一个组既能查卡组织 chargeback，也能查钱包手续费，但只有两人有 chargeback 权限）；<strong>容量瓶颈</strong>（正确队列里的人都满了，工单应该溢出而不是排队等待）；<strong>跨时区交接</strong>（欧洲的差异在北京时间凌晨产生，应该分给正在值班的亚太组，而不是等到欧洲组上班）。</p>\n<p>把路由当成&quot;属性匹配 + 容量约束&quot;的约束满足问题，而不是查表，才能自然支持这三种情况。</p>\n<h2 id=\"匹配规则-从固定映射到技能标签\">匹配规则：从固定映射到技能标签</h2><h3 id=\"能力集合与需求集合\">能力集合与需求集合</h3><p>正确做法是给两侧都打标签，做集合匹配：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工单侧属性</th>\n<th>处理者侧能力</th>\n<th>匹配语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>diff_type</code>（短款/长款/FX/手续费）</td>\n<td>可处理的差异类型</td>\n<td>必须包含</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>currency</code>（USD/EUR/JPY…）</td>\n<td>可处理币种</td>\n<td>必须包含（或无限制）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>channel_family</code>（卡组织/钱包/本地清算）</td>\n<td>可处理渠道族</td>\n<td>必须包含</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>amount_band</code>（&lt;1k / 1k–100k / &gt;100k）</td>\n<td>授权金额上限</td>\n<td>能力上限 ≥ 工单金额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>region</code>（EU/APAC/LATAM）</td>\n<td>语言与法域</td>\n<td>优先匹配，非硬约束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行不是硬约束是有意的：如果 <code>region</code> 是硬约束，欧洲的差异在北京时间凌晨就只能排队；把它降级为&quot;优先匹配&quot;，配合跨时区备份组，才能做到 24 小时不落地。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分派算法的实际形态\">分派算法的实际形态</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def assign(case, handlers, now):&#10;    eligible = [&#10;        h for h in handlers&#10;        if case.diff_type in h.skills.diff_types&#10;        and (h.skills.currencies is None or case.currency in h.skills.currencies)&#10;        and case.channel_family in h.skills.channel_families&#10;        and case.amount_minor &lt;= h.skills.max_amount_minor&#10;        and h.is_on_duty(now)&#10;    ]&#10;    if not eligible:&#10;        return None&#10;    scored = sorted(&#10;        eligible,&#10;        key=lambda h: (&#10;            0 if case.region in h.regions else 1,&#10;            h.current_load / h.capacity,&#10;            h.handled_recent_same_channel,&#10;        ),&#10;    )&#10;    return scored[0]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> assign</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(case, handlers, now):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    eligible </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> handlers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case.diff_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h.skills.diff_types</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (h.skills.currencies </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case.currency </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h.skills.currencies)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case.channel_family </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h.skills.channel_families</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case.amount_minor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h.skills.max_amount_minor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h.is_on_duty(now)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eligible:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scored </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sorted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        eligible,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h: (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case.region </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h.regions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            h.current_load </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h.capacity,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            h.handled_recent_same_channel,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scored[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>排序键的顺序才是策略本身：先按地域亲和，再按负载率，最后按&quot;最近是否已在处理同渠道&quot;。第三个键容易被忽略但很关键——同一个人已经在查某渠道的差异，再给他一张同渠道的单边际成本极低（同一份文件、同一套上下文）；而给一个全新的人，成本包含了重新理解渠道特性的全部开销。</p>\n<h3 id=\"回退链与溢出策略\">回退链与溢出策略</h3><p><code>eligible</code> 为空时会走到回退链上，回退链必须显式定义而不是&quot;分给默认组&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>回退动作</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>SLA 影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>溢出到备份地域组</td>\n<td>主队列全员满载</td>\n<td>时钟不停</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>溢出到上级组（组长队列）</td>\n<td>备份组也满载</td>\n<td>时钟不停，触发容量告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>延时重试（15 分钟后重跑分派）</td>\n<td>全员不在岗</td>\n<td>时钟不停</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>落入中央未分派池</td>\n<td>连续 3 次重试失败</td>\n<td>时钟不停，触发人工介入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键约定：<strong>SLA 时钟在任何回退中都不暂停</strong>。这一点与&quot;等待外部回复&quot;完全不同——等待渠道回函是我方不可控的，暂停是合理的；而没有合适的人接单是我方容量问题，如果因此暂停时钟，容量不足就永远不会暴露。这条约定直接决定了 <a href=\"case-sla-escalation\">工单 SLA 与升级</a> 里&quot;哪些状态暂停时钟&quot;的边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"队列容量与在办上限的定量约束\">队列容量与在办上限的定量约束</h2><h3 id=\"为什么必须设上限而不是让队列无穷深\">为什么必须设上限而不是让队列无穷深</h3><p>如果一个组可以无限接单，队列会一直增长而响应时间悄悄恶化到再也追不上。排队论给出了这个现象的严格形式：在 M/M/1 近似下，平均排队等待时间为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>μ</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_q = \\frac{\\rho}{1-\\rho}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\mu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.988em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2019em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\lambda/\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 是利用率（到达率与处理率之比），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 是单人处理速率（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/M/M/1_queue\">M/M/1 queue</a>）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时分母趋零，等待时间无界增长——<strong>利用率从 80% 提到 90% 会让等待时间翻倍</strong>，这正是运营团队&quot;再加一点班就能清掉&quot;的直觉为什么总是失效。</p>\n<p>因此正确的做法是<strong>按利用率目标反推在办上限</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>max</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>sla</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{max}} = \\rho_{\\text{target}} \\cdot \\mu \\cdot T_{\\text{sla}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">max</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sla</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如目标利用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_{\\text{target}} = 0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span>、单人平均处理 6 张/天、SLA 为 3 天，则在办上限约为 14 张。超过这个数就说明该组需要扩容或分流，而不是让它在办数继续涨。</p>\n<h3 id=\"队列健康度的日常观测\">队列健康度的日常观测</h3><p>Little 定律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span> 给出了在办数、到达率与停留时间之间的恒等关系（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Little%27s_law\">Little&#39;s law</a>），它不需要任何分布假设就可以直接用来交叉验证观测数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT q.queue_id,&#10;       q.wip                                                    AS l_in_system,&#10;       round(3600.0 * count(*) FILTER (&#10;         WHERE c.case_created_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;24 hours&#39;&#10;       ) / 86400, 2)                                            AS lambda_per_sec,&#10;       round(avg(extract(epoch FROM c.first_action_at - c.case_created_at))&#10;             / 3600, 2)                                         AS w_hours,&#10;       round(q.wip / nullif(avg(extract(epoch FROM&#10;         c.first_action_at - c.case_created_at)) / 3600, 0), 2) AS implied_lambda&#10;FROM case_queue q&#10;JOIN recon_case c ON c.queue_id = q.queue_id&#10;WHERE c.state IN (&#39;assigned&#39;, &#39;investigating&#39;)&#10;GROUP BY q.queue_id, q.wip&#10;ORDER BY w_hours DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> q</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">queue_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       q</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">wip</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                                    AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> l_in_system,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">case_created_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'24 hours'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 86400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lambda_per_sec,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(extract(epoch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">first_action_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">case_created_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w_hours,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">q</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">wip</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nullif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(extract(epoch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">first_action_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">case_created_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3600</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> implied_lambda</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> case_queue q</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recon_case c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">queue_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> q</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">queue_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'assigned'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'investigating'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> q</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">queue_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">q</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">wip</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w_hours </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>lambda_per_sec</code> 与 <code>implied_lambda</code> 应当接近。两者差得远通常意味着数据有问题（工单被重复计入、状态未正确流转），而不是业务异常——先查数据再查人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分派记录与可追溯性\">分派记录与可追溯性</h2><p>分派决定必须落库，否则&quot;为什么这张单给了他&quot;在生产事故复盘时无法回答。审计轨迹（audit trail）的基本要求是记录<strong>谁</strong>在<strong>何时</strong>对<strong>哪个对象</strong>做了什么操作（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Audit_trail\">Audit trail</a>），对分派而言还要记录&quot;为什么这么选&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;case_id&quot;: &quot;CS-2026-09-004312&quot;,&#10;  &quot;assignment_seq&quot;: 2,&#10;  &quot;assigned_to&quot;: &quot;u_7f3a91c2&quot;,&#10;  &quot;assigned_by&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;engine&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;router-2026.09.2&quot; },&#10;  &quot;reason&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;matched_skills&quot;: [&quot;shortage&quot;, &quot;USD&quot;, &quot;card_network&quot;],&#10;    &quot;region_affinity&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;load_ratio_at_assign&quot;: 0.61,&#10;    &quot;fallback_level&quot;: 0,&#10;    &quot;candidates_considered&quot;: 4&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;previous_assignee&quot;: &quot;u_2b8c44e1&quot;,&#10;  &quot;reassign_reason&quot;: &quot;out_of_office_period_ended&quot;,&#10;  &quot;assigned_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T06:31:12Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"case_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CS-2026-09-004312\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"assignment_seq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"assigned_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"u_7f3a91c2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"assigned_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"engine\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"router-2026.09.2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"matched_skills\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"shortage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"card_network\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"region_affinity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"load_ratio_at_assign\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.61</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"fallback_level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"candidates_considered\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"previous_assignee\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"u_2b8c44e1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reassign_reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"out_of_office_period_ended\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"assigned_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T06:31:12Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>candidates_considered</code> 与 <code>load_ratio_at_assign</code> 是事后解释分派质量的关键：当一张单在 3 天内转了 5 手，你需要能回答&quot;是没人会，还是没人有空&quot;。前者要靠技能矩阵扩充，后者要靠容量扩容——两者的修复动作完全不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>路由是&quot;属性匹配 + 容量约束&quot;的约束满足问题，不是一张渠道到组的映射表。</li>\n<li>工单侧与处理者侧都用标签集合表达能力，<code>region</code> 应作为亲和度而非硬约束，否则跨时区会产生无人可接的空档。</li>\n<li>排序键的顺序就是策略：地域亲和 → 负载率 → 同渠道在办，第三项能把上下文复用成本降到最低。</li>\n<li>SLA 时钟在任何分派回退中都不暂停；容量不足必须暴露，不能靠暂停时钟掩盖。</li>\n<li>在办上限按目标利用率反推 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mi>μ</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>sla</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\max} = \\rho_{\\text{target}}\\mu T_{\\text{sla}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sla</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，不要靠&quot;再加点班&quot;；用 Little 定律交叉验证队列数据。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>工单落到人之后，调查需要证据——见 <a href=\"evidence-link-investigate\">证据挂链与调查作业</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"例外工单分派与路由","id":"例外工单分派与路由"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：路由是匹配问题，不是查表问题","id":"核心概念-路由是匹配问题-不是查表问题"},{"level":2,"text":"匹配规则：从固定映射到技能标签","id":"匹配规则-从固定映射到技能标签"},{"level":3,"text":"能力集合与需求集合","id":"能力集合与需求集合"},{"level":3,"text":"分派算法的实际形态","id":"分派算法的实际形态"},{"level":3,"text":"回退链与溢出策略","id":"回退链与溢出策略"},{"level":2,"text":"队列容量与在办上限的定量约束","id":"队列容量与在办上限的定量约束"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么必须设上限而不是让队列无穷深","id":"为什么必须设上限而不是让队列无穷深"},{"level":3,"text":"队列健康度的日常观测","id":"队列健康度的日常观测"},{"level":2,"text":"分派记录与可追溯性","id":"分派记录与可追溯性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"例外规则与容差阈值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/exception-classify-match/exception-rule-threshold"},"next":{"title":"证据挂链与调查作业","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/case-investigation-sla/evidence-link-investigate"}}